# With three energy Bot1 accepts the payment on turn 3 while one Ornithopter and the Guide attack. The reflexive trigger's target must be an attacking
# creature: the Ornithopters that stayed home are not candidates (the refusal), the attacker is, and gets two +1/+1 counters, flying and Angel.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Guide of Souls
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x2
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Guide of Souls.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Energy = 3
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter; Guide of Souls)
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Target(Ornithopter#2)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter#1)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Energy = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Subtypes = Angel; Thopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
